{"posts":[{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_51","t":"Away\n\nThere are lot of way to trade, yes you can be profitable only with trend-lines by continuously observing the charts, you can be profitable only by watching indicators, but what is important is how will you trade with naked eyes. BTW, this is my simplification towards trading. Setting up few rules which will make my trading more relaxing.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#51","p":3,"im":["7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d","6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5"],"m":51},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_52","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#52","p":3,"im":["81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5"],"m":52},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_53","t":"Away\n\nkavya wrote:\n\nI just loves it!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#53","p":3,"im":["7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d","6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5","7b772974ad265f20e52e66d1181cd35413ca1a9d"],"m":53},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_54","t":"","a":"Kovalenko","d":"","n":"#54","p":3,"im":["f852860ed6026a1c085763f3c4bb2deae74ad3d9"],"m":54},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_55","t":"Away\n\nkavya wrote:\n\nYes Mr.Market tell me \"Is this important level?","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#55","p":3,"im":["3c568e7a8195840df574da529a3653e7752f54d5","112fd658b2d7a7289f2a214377d09dca4d096c29"],"m":55},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_56","t":"Away\n\nIf you want to be real traders, then always use SET type of trades, and don't take any partial profits, always place your profit line at your opposite entry line where you will like to trade. Try to be Leading player of the game not side player of the game. That's what I learned from RTM.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#56","p":3,"im":[],"m":56},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_57","t":"Away\n\nkavya wrote:\n\nSL Hit!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#57","p":3,"im":["81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5"],"m":57},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_58","t":"Away\n\nIfmyante wrote: I'll be doing a lot of mind dumping in here for a while. Take nothing as a complete lesson unless I've said it is\n\nIf your rectangle is above price, it must always be drawn from a low to the highest high on its right. If your rectangle is below price, it must always be drawn from an high to the lowest low on its right. To be tradeable, rectangles must cross lines drawn from highs and lows to the left","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#58","p":3,"im":["74630942df44a4f4ca741c0f657f139a002a2632"],"m":58},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_59","t":"Away\n\nAs of now price looks in Balance state at S from above and D from below is acting. though we can have look where it last time bounced couple of time. It was WRB! so what my thinking is price might find few orders into demand before riding up. though until balance turns into inbalance there is no clear way to make any decision. let's step down to one TF.\n\nNow on H1 we have Monthly line at 41977.25. It was where last time price was rejected to downside. Also that rejection had engulfed big FL on it's left. which is big PA. and as price engulfed that PA we can expect opposite reaction to same PA. so now we are lined up with failed QM and RS Flip as well as demand cluster which is also reacting to FL so expecting that current balance will be resolved south before heading north!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#59","p":3,"im":["b0110713ca4157559afa549dd6041403fd86b34d","ac7c4e99202344c7e695f8fb1f88dd65c5b9d82f"],"m":59},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_60","t":"Away\n\nkavya wrote:\n\nIfmyante wrote: I'll be doing a lot of mind dumping in here for a while. Take nothing as a complete lesson unless I've said it is\n\nIf your rectangle is above price, it must always be drawn from a low to the highest high on its right. If your rectangle is below price, it must always be drawn from an high to the lowest low on its right. To be tradeable, rectangles must cross lines drawn from highs and lows to the left","a":"Al3cs","d":"","n":"#60","p":3,"im":["74630942df44a4f4ca741c0f657f139a002a2632"],"m":60},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_61","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#61","p":3,"im":["ba49d099336880ac9b1625ffcd36e3bb6a3f80b6"],"m":61},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_62","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#62","p":3,"im":["b4bd4e20fb5d9d6cea5480117e5e8a7d0d2049e8","077b44232f30102f70f811d1091d213c2b990e40"],"m":62},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_63","t":"Away\n\nPrice breaks into CP demand. Once it engulf MPL of CP I will look at other end of the symmetry of old swing.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#63","p":3,"im":["cc865451a1782ae6dd2811ed7d08fd37fd0777d3"],"m":63},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_64","t":"Away\n\nKovalenko wrote:\n\nYes that supply was exhausted, but why should we fight when price is giving us opportunity for few weeks?","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#64","p":3,"im":["f852860ed6026a1c085763f3c4bb2deae74ad3d9","585de9042a970d542714b986cfd58c9c6ad98746"],"m":64},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_65","t":"Away\n\nI got few pip at invisible kink and covered few at opposite kink!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#65","p":3,"im":["a8a5fbfc7de0485b9b3fe4dc4a6befc306b88b77"],"m":65},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_66","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#66","p":3,"im":["3183e2e99f3eb3f78320fcc9a1a884e9fd140ac5"],"m":66},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_67","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#67","p":3,"im":["24240c870ea8d304f8e137dd0dd6f2317856c00f"],"m":67},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_68","t":"Kavya","a":"—","d":"","n":"#68","p":3,"im":[],"m":68},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_69","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#69","p":3,"im":["608645d14e74717b4d3d68b407d064ebfb649185","f986f4954f9c6c33c65e19134cae84feed89cc7f"],"m":69},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_70","t":"Away\n\nHey guys, just a small lesson on how to trade candle PA!\n\nInfact, candlesticks are great to find out the Kinks. But which candle we should look for?\n\nI personally like to look for Swing High Candle or Swing Low Candle. Break of Swing High candle is like breaking some kind of RS in LTF which might exist on left. But if CAPS forms near SHC (Swing High Candle) or SLC (Swing Low Candle) that is even great as it is FTB to MPL!\n\nBut if we have LS below or nearby to SHC (or SLC) then the low of that candle again becomes important RS Flip. But if there is QM on LS with just 2 candles then that QM is also need to pay attention.\n\nYes, MPL’s are great placed to trade for FO when they are just near to Kink or what my friend Sali named ORFL.\n\nIf you look for every candle, it means less but when you look for SHC and SLC along with PA and Kink it will definitely help you out to take to the pip entries!\n\nWhat inspired me to look for candle PA?\n\nRTM’s old article which is now locked kept ditching my mind every time that IF started candle PA means there must be something there to look for candle. But then many time I lost looking for old terms all over internet. But then suddenly I got surprised when I was looking for engulf of candle. Then I got my eureka moment and sharp bounce to next level of trading.\n\nThanks to my curiosity to take me to RTM, and thanks to all Masters and specially IF for educating peoples for free and giving me 2nd chance!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#70","p":3,"im":["cde30813a8a2cf205a1319176fea6724e00ef053","f0a4077077e2b4f47a05a2d3cf33bcc820ad36ab","19b4613b17ab1199559a34e9513a5c1a6a81a192","a3fdff3afc61f43967964697a281282a825ca5b1"],"m":70},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_71","t":"Away","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#71","p":3,"im":["0d2d074709d5e81e55d0180e197d866ac56a4a0e"],"m":71},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_72","t":"Away\n\nYes though IF said to keep SL below LL, in this case I don't want to be killed by double bottoms, price will go swiftly down, without even 1:1 bump for any BE. Though looking at it's fundamental don't think it's gonna go down!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#72","p":3,"im":["403351667966f8cc11bc93c3916b21839010468b"],"m":72},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_73","t":"Away\n\nI think orders left by ITs on the way up at old trick area!","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#73","p":3,"im":["28e9ee95cd476145b937429cb9c7c3d9e777ae32"],"m":73},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_74","t":"Away\n\nMonthly reaction from MPL. Target is opposite MPL or QM!\n\nEntry is another Kink on Daily which is also SOE of few Local Swing.","a":"Kavya","d":"","n":"#74","p":3,"im":["562a892fb025406745feaaab3db2754617b6a4fe","b216f3a3da0999c4cbaa916af527d819f13489ce"],"m":74},{"id":"homeoffinisher_p3_75","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"","n":"#75","p":3,"im":["ff38ba5b9d7ceb79e306da450b8cba11f715a78f"],"m":75}],"images":[{"k":"3c568e7a8195840df574da529a3653e7752f54d5","t":"assets/thumbs/3c568e7a8195840df574da529a3653e7752f54d5.webp","f":"assets/images/3c568e7a8195840df574da529a3653e7752f54d5.png","w":1173,"h":675,"b":59965,"o":"3c568e7a8195840df574da529a3653e7752f54d5.png","p":3,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p3_55"},{"k":"7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d","t":"assets/thumbs/7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d.webp","f":"assets/images/7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d.png","w":1173,"h":675,"b":51967,"o":"7ac3c1784f4df674f807e30e4e07886487335a1d.png","p":3,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p3_53"},{"k":"6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5","t":"assets/thumbs/6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5.webp","f":"assets/images/6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5.png","w":1173,"h":675,"b":53759,"o":"6814f5f98b1e2dcbe3a413b737c36b32d99dafc5.png","p":3,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p3_53"},{"k":"81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5","t":"assets/thumbs/81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5.webp","f":"assets/images/81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5.png","w":1173,"h":675,"b":56037,"o":"81ba8e7ffa0dc575182475b19b312218a871a6d5.png","p":3,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p3_57"},{"k":"7b772974ad265f20e52e66d1181cd35413ca1a9d","t":"assets/thumbs/7b772974ad265f20e52e66d1181cd35413ca1a9d.webp","f":"assets/images/7b772974ad265f20e52e66d1181cd35413ca1a9d.png","w":1173,"h":675,"b":42064,"o":"7b772974ad265f20e52e66d1181cd35413ca1a9d.png","p":3,"pid":"homeoffinisher_p3_53"},{"k":"f852860ed6026a1c085763f3c4bb2deae74ad3d9","t":"assets/thumbs/f852860ed6026a1c085763f3c4bb2deae74ad3d9.webp","f":"assets/images/